# MODULE 08 – Practice Lab: `SIGINT`, `SIGHUP`, aur `nohup`
> **Hands-on Practice Lab – Processes ko Interrupt Karna aur Terminal Band Hone ke Baad bhi Jobs ko Chalaye Rakhna**

---

# 🎯 Lab Objective

Is practice lab mein aap seekhenge:

- `SIGINT` signal ko samajhna.
- `Ctrl + C` press karne par kya hota hai.
- `SIGHUP` signal ko samajhna.
- Jab controlling terminal band hota hai to kya hota hai.
- `pstree` command se process relationships dekhna.
- Samajhna ke background jobs logout ke baad kyun terminate ho sakti hain.
