# 4. `SIGINT` Manually Send Karna

Background mein process start karein:

```bash
sleep 500 &
```

Job ID aur PID dekhein:

```bash
jobs -l
```

Example:

```text
[1]+ 2548 Running sleep 500 &
```

Ab PID use karke `SIGINT` bhejein:

```bash
kill -SIGINT 2548
```

Ya:

```bash
kill -2 2548
```

Verify karein:

```bash
ps -p 2548
```

Agar process `SIGINT` handle karta hai to woh list mein nazar nahi aayega.

