# `SIGINT` Ki Important Property

Har process:

- `SIGINT` ko catch kar sakta hai.
- `SIGINT` ko handle kar sakta hai.
- `SIGINT` ko ignore bhi kar sakta hai.

Is liye har application `Ctrl + C` press karne par zaroor terminate nahi hoti.

Lekin aksar command-line tools `Ctrl + C` ke baad terminate ho jate hain.

---

# 5. `SIGINT` aur `SIGTERM` Mein Difference

| Feature | `SIGINT` | `SIGTERM` |
|----------|----------|-----------|
| Signal Number | `2` | `15` |
| Common Source | `Ctrl + C` | `kill PID` |
| Purpose | Current kaam ko interrupt karna | Process ko gracefully terminate karna |
| Handle kiya ja sakta hai | Yes | Yes |
| Ignore kiya ja sakta hai | Yes | Yes |
| Common Use | Interactive foreground command stop karna | Service ya process ko safely band karna |

