# 10. Jab Terminal Band Hota Hai To Kya Hota Hai?

Agar aap terminal band kar dete hain ya SSH session disconnect ho jata hai to:

- Controlling shell exit ho sakta hai.
- Shell apne jobs ko `SIGHUP` bhej sakta hai.
- Kuch jobs terminate ho jati hain.
- Kuch jobs chalti rehti hain agar woh `SIGHUP` ko handle ya ignore karti hain.

Is liye normal background process ke survive karne ki guarantee nahi hoti.

---

# Terminal Closure Flow

```text
Background Job Running
        │
        ▼
Terminal Ya SSH Session Band
        │
        ▼
Shell Hangup Process Karta Hai
        │
        ▼
Jobs Ko SIGHUP Mil Sakta Hai
        │
        ├──────── Process Terminate
        │
        └──────── Process SIGHUP Ignore Kare Aur Chalta Rahe
```

