# 12. `SIGHUP` Ka Dusra Common Use

Bohat se Linux daemons `SIGHUP` ko is liye use karte hain ke:

> **Service ko restart kiye baghair configuration dobara load ki ja sake.**

Example:

```bash
kill -HUP PID
```

Lekin yaad rakhein:

Har application `SIGHUP` receive karne ke baad reload nahi karti.

Agar service `systemd` ke through manage ho rahi ho to hamesha uski documented reload command use karein.

Example:

```bash
systemctl reload service_name
```

